    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel as Lucky, an arrogant greaser, as she battles the Devil and her legion of darkness.\u00a0 Sentenced to an eternity of reaping souls with no final exit in sight, she\u2019ll take down every Devil-sent demon and undead summoned to torment her, and leave them hitchhiking for eternity. Leather jackets, pompadours, grease, and gasoline. A world gushing with style as thick as oil and <strong>carnage at 100mph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gunning for the End of the Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Road Reaper, you\u2019re bound to the very highway where you drew your last breath and condemned to harvest mortal souls for what may be eternity. Yet behind the wheel, you are a force to be reckoned with and you've got that shotgun shine. You'll <strong>gun down</strong> every Devil-sent demon and undead on your way to that elusive end of the road. With each attempt to <strong>escape your hell</strong>, you'll <strong>grow stronger</strong> and unravel more about yourself and the world you're tethered to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks, Powers, and Pit Stops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to make a pit stop? Make <strong>strategic stops</strong> and visit other Road Reapers on route who will lend you their powers and help you go that extra mile. <strong><i>Choose</i></strong> to visit key allies along the way to score new perks, abilities, and skills, which when combined <strong>create powerful character builds</strong> that\u2019ll make the Devil herself tremble in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Geared for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two attempts to escape your tether are ever the same. With each attempt, <strong>discover</strong> more about your fellow Reapers, the fiends who stand in your way, and even yourself. Enemies who get the best of you and ran you off the road in previous runs will remember you. Stop by the Junkyard to purchase <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> to <i>soup-up</i> your ride and earn that revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Devil\u2019s Diabolical Designs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil is always one step ahead as she orchestrates her symphony of carnage against you. Enemies sent to stop your escape will differ in number and strength, as she <strong>watches your every move</strong> and fine-tunes her strategy. She is always <strong>plotting against you</strong>.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the wheel as Lucky, an arrogant greaser, as she battles the Devil and her legion of darkness.\u00a0 Sentenced to an eternity of reaping souls with no final exit in sight, she\u2019ll take down every Devil-sent demon and undead summoned to torment her, and leave them hitchhiking for eternity. Leather jackets, pompadours, grease, and gasoline. A world gushing with style as thick as oil and <strong>carnage at 100mph</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/6d3260d5566b52dba05f8bdb76a638ee.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gunning for the End of the Road</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Road Reaper, you\u2019re bound to the very highway where you drew your last breath and condemned to harvest mortal souls for what may be eternity. Yet behind the wheel, you are a force to be reckoned with and you've got that shotgun shine. You'll <strong>gun down</strong> every Devil-sent demon and undead on your way to that elusive end of the road. With each attempt to <strong>escape your hell</strong>, you'll <strong>grow stronger</strong> and unravel more about yourself and the world you're tethered to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/abb008089e743174d9bb23a51091f710.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks, Powers, and Pit Stops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to make a pit stop? Make <strong>strategic stops</strong> and visit other Road Reapers on route who will lend you their powers and help you go that extra mile. <strong><i>Choose</i></strong> to visit key allies along the way to score new perks, abilities, and skills, which when combined <strong>create powerful character builds</strong> that\u2019ll make the Devil herself tremble in fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/e049c4b91af895827fbbb3437603bca5.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Geared for Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two attempts to escape your tether are ever the same. With each attempt, <strong>discover</strong> more about your fellow Reapers, the fiends who stand in your way, and even yourself. Enemies who get the best of you and ran you off the road in previous runs will remember you. Stop by the Junkyard to purchase <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> to <i>soup-up</i> your ride and earn that revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.poster.avif?t=1749884103\" width=520 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.webm?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3238240/extras/d70072f45b020e531e4b8ee1ff627ed2.mp4?t=1749884103\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Devil\u2019s Diabolical Designs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Devil is always one step ahead as she orchestrates her symphony of carnage against you. Enemies sent to stop your escape will differ in number and strength, as she <strong>watches your every move</strong> and fine-tunes her strategy. She is always <strong>plotting against you</strong>.\u00a0</p>",
